# Feroot Security

> Feroot is a Toronto-based cybersecurity company providing AI-powered
> client-side security and compliance automation for websites and mobile
> apps. The platform automates compliance with PCI DSS 4.0.1 (requirements
> 6.4.3 and 11.6.1), HIPAA, GDPR, CCPA/CPRA, and 70+ global regulations.

## Products

- [DXComply](https://feroot.com/dxcomply/): Automates privacy compliance and consent audits across GDPR, CCPA, HIPAA, and 70+ regulations. Continuously discovers scripts, cookies, and data flows.
- [PaymentGuard](https://feroot.com/pci-paymentguard/): PCI DSS 4.0.1 compliance automation for payment pages. Automates requirements 6.4.3 (script inventory) and 11.6.1 (tamper detection).
- [DXSecure](https://feroot.com/dxsecure/): Client-side script security and protection. Detects and blocks malicious scripts, formjacking, Magecart, and data exfiltration in real time.
- [Platform Overview](https://feroot.com/platform-overview/): Full description of the Feroot Digital User Experience Security and Compliance Platform.

